{"title": "Brand of the Absolute", "pageid": 3509, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Branded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Branded.png/300px-Branded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Branded.png/450px-Branded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b4/Branded.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Branded.png/300px-Branded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"241\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Branded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  The Brand of the Absolute  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Brand of the Absolute</b> is an optional <a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_Bonuses\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Permanent Bonuses\">permanent bonus</a> that leads to unique dialogue options and powerful item interactions.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The brand is a combination of the symbols of each of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Three\" title=\"Dead Three\">Dead Three</a>: the black hand of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/19px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/26px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp/13px-Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Bane_Deity_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bane_(deity)\" title=\"Bane (deity)\">Bane</a>, the bloody skull of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>, and the triangle-inset skull of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/30px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/40px-Myrkul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Myrkul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp/20px-Myrkul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Myrkul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Myrkul\" title=\"Myrkul\">Myrkul</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Becoming_Branded\">Becoming Branded</span></h2>\n<p>A party member may become branded by speaking to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/38px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/50px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a>. After branding them, she attempts to mentally connect to their parasite and ask them to join her in her private chapel. After this conversation, Gut no longer offers to brand additional characters, but any party member can receive the brand by speaking to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/25px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/38px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/50px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warlock Greez\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png/25px-Portrait_Greez.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Portrait_Greez.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greez\" title=\"Greez\">Warlock Greez</a>.\n</p><p>Becoming branded has the following consequences:\n</p>\n<ul><li>A one-time disapproval from the following <a href=\"/wiki/Companions\" title=\"Companions\">Companions</a>:<span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/39px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/52px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/26px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/39px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/52px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart disapproves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #cc3f49 ;\">-1</span></span></li>\n<li>\"Branded\" appears in the <a href=\"/wiki/Tags\" title=\"Tags\">Tags</a> section of the character's Detailed View.\n<ul><li>The tag may not show up if the character is disguised.</li></ul></li>\n<li>\"Branded\" Dialogue options become available.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Branded_dialogue\">Branded dialogue</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brakkal\" title=\"Brakkal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Brakkal.png/25px-Portrait_Brakkal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Brakkal.png/38px-Portrait_Brakkal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Brakkal.png/50px-Portrait_Brakkal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brakkal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Brakkal.png/25px-Portrait_Brakkal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Brakkal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brakkal\" title=\"Brakkal\">Brakkal</a> recognizes the brand and subsequently refuses to talk to the branded character.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/25px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/38px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/50px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fezzerk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/25px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\">Fezzerk</a> obliges and leaves <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/25px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/38px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/50px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barcus Wroot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/25px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a> alone, leaving the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> afterwards.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/25px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/38px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/50px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gekh Coal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/25px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a> backs down without a dialogue check at the <a href=\"/wiki/Decrepit_Village\" title=\"Decrepit Village\">Decrepit Village</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greymon\" title=\"Greymon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Greymon.png/25px-Portrait_Greymon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Greymon.png/38px-Portrait_Greymon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Greymon.png/50px-Portrait_Greymon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Corsair Greymon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Greymon.png/25px-Portrait_Greymon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Portrait_Greymon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greymon\" title=\"Greymon\">Corsair Greymon</a> requires an easier dialogue check, made with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>, to back down on the skiff in the Underdark.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/38px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/50px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump</a> and his fellow Ogres back down without a dialogue check at the Blighted Village.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Item_synergy\">Item synergy</span></h2>\n<p>The following pieces of equipment require the Absolute's brand to function at their full potential:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Protector\" title=\"Absolute's Protector\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Protector\" title=\"Absolute's Protector\">Absolute's Protector</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Talisman\" title=\"Absolute's Talisman\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Talisman\" title=\"Absolute's Talisman\">Absolute's Talisman</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Warboard\" title=\"Absolute's Warboard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Absolute%27s_Warboard_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Warboard\" title=\"Absolute's Warboard\">Absolute's Warboard</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Gloves_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Power\" title=\"Gloves of Power\">Gloves of Power</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Absolute_Force\" title=\"Ring of Absolute Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thu